  "body": "Catch 'стоп' after the wake word and ignore rustle.\n\n- prebuffer 500 ms -> 1.2 s so 'Алиса, стоп' reaches ASR whole\n- barge-in needs 300 ms of speech with crest < 4.5\n- follow-up trigger needs 240 ms of speech with crest < 4.5\n- user-controllable OTA config and stable 10-minute checks\n- 'стоп', 'выключи радио', 'стоп радио' kill the radio pipeline\n- includes radio, wake-word, pre-duck and periodic OTA fixes",
